{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "port_developers_advice",
  "spec": ["port-developers 4.3", "port-developers 4.5", "port-developers 12"],
  "description": "Section 12 test 6: 9700 trips on a 10000 small airport at stage 0 in state 3: GrowthTriggered (9700 >= 10000 x 0.96), so GROW_SMALL_AIRPORT1 (0xEA394B74) is pushed once; efficiency 0.03 <= 0.25 and the lot has not changed state for 91 days: condition 2. At 90 days the condition goes back to 0. Only the first triggered port in list order is offered each month; a constructing lot (state 2) and a lot in state 0 are not offered; a port at a later stage gets the stage-2 event (0xCB3BE815); a medium airport at stage 0 gets 0xEB3BE415.",
  "steps": [
    {"op": "pd_create", "kind": "airport"},
    {"op": "pd_init"},
    {"op": "pd_lot", "lot": "0x10", "config": ["0xCA2436C0", 1], "x": 3, "z": 4, "rect": [3, 4, 7, 6], "days": 91, "state": 3},
    {"op": "pd_occupant", "occupant": "0x100", "lot": "0x10"},
    {"op": "pd_message", "msg": "0x99EF1142", "data": "0x100"},
    {"op": "pd_env", "offices": [[9700], [0]]},
    {"op": "pd_clear_events"},
    {"op": "pd_month"},
    {"op": "pd_expect_events", "events": [{"event": "effects", "lot": "0x10", "old": 0, "new": 0.97}, {"event": "condition", "lot": "0x10", "condition": 2}, {"event": "advisor", "id": "0xEA394B74"}, {"event": "history", "key": "0x6A3E9032", "value": 3}]},
    {"op": "pd_expect_port", "index": 0, "state": {"trips": 9700, "efficiency": 0.03}},
    {"op": "pd_expect", "state": {"event": "0xEA394B74"}},
    {"op": "pd_lot", "lot": "0x10", "days": 90},
    {"op": "pd_month"},
    {"op": "pd_expect_events", "filter": {"event": "condition"}, "events": [{"event": "condition", "lot": "0x10", "condition": 0}]},

    {"op": "pd_lot", "lot": "0x11", "config": ["0x6A5126D0", 1], "x": 30, "z": 4, "rect": [30, 4, 34, 6], "subnetworks": [1]},
    {"op": "pd_occupant", "occupant": "0x101", "lot": "0x11"},
    {"op": "pd_message", "msg": "0x99EF1142", "data": "0x101"},
    {"op": "pd_env", "offices": [[9700, 52000], [0, 0]]},
